# script_chapter4.rpy
#
# Chapter 4. Ana takes a call from her sister while driving home.

label chapter_four:
    scene bg car sunset
    show ana default 

    n "As I was driving home from work, my ringtone blared out of the car's speakers. Aghh, my sister. I picked up the call."

    o "Hey Ana!! I finally got time to call you, the baby is down for a nap and Carlos is making dinner, so my hands are free. 
    How are you doing?! How's the new job?"

    a "Hi Sophia! It's been good, I've been there 8 months so it's barely new any more. But y'know, crunching numbers, turning 
    a profit."

    o "Ahh 8 months is still rookie numbers! You'll get it when you're in your 30s. Is it challenging?"

    a "Nothing I can't handle! Accounting was a good choice, Mama and Papa were right about the money. "

    o "I'm so happy to hear that! I know they were worried about you back when you were in high school since your grades 
    weren't the best."

    a "I don't think a few B minuses were actually worth being worried about."

    nvl clear

    o "Well, you know how they are!"

    o "What else is up? Any hot dates recently?"

    a "Ahh, some cute guys but they didn't really go anywhere. I'll keep trying."

    o "Yeahh, I certainly don't miss dating!"

    a "How are Carlos and baby Davey?"

    o "They're doing great! Davey is exhausting though, I think I get about 10 minutes of free time per day and 3 hours of sleep. "

    o "Speaking of which, Carlos just finished dinner, I gotta run! Good talking! Love you!"

    a "Bye! Love you too!"

    nvl clear

    n "Mannn. She's so much older than me she often feels more like a mom than a sister. She's the golden child too, I was 
    always following in her footsteps. Effortlessly put-together, polite, straight As, and a big girl job right out of college. "

    scene bg apt sunset

    n "I pull into my parking space and head upstairs to my apartment. I forgot to get groceries on the way home, so I guess 
    I'll order takeout. Or check the fridge and see if there's any left overs."

    scene bg livingroom sunset2

    n "There's leftover pizza...I guess that'll work."

    scene bg bedroom sunset2

    n "I settled down on my bed with my pizza and my laptop, and opened up one of my favorite true crime Youtubers. The sting of 
    talking to my family and feeling inadequate hurts a bit less with carbs and cheap thrills. "

    nvl clear
    scene bg bedroom night

    n "For a few hours, I melted into my bed. A cheesy, tragedy fueled puddle of goo. Something about hearing about the worst 
    possible scenarios and the worst possible people was comforting. It made me feel safer, and a little bit more prepared."

    n "I winced when I caught a glimpse of my scrunched up, vacant face looking back at me from the laptop screen. With the crumbs 
    of pizza spilling onto my mattress, I felt more like a lazy teenager than a successful adult woman."

    n "Honestly maybe I could learn something from that Instagram lady. Either become more successful, or stop giving a fuck about 
    what anyone thinks. I give way too many fucks. "

    n "I opened up her page and looked at the courses she offered. Mostly yoga stuff, tantra.\"Awaken Your Divine Feminine\".... 
    I tapped on the video."

    nvl clear

    s "Greetings, loves! I'm here with a new opportunity for you all called  \"Awakening Your Divine Feminine\". "

    s "Women come to me feeling lost. Severed from their femininity, their moon goddess connection. It's my greatest calling to 
    help restore their natural glow. "

    s "After working with me, they've told me about feeling a newfound confidence. Walking taller, making eye contact without 
    flinching, commanding rooms with their powerful voices. It's beautiful watching them remember their divine right to pleasure, 
    passion and self-love."

    s "This somatic ritual is key to that awakening. We will dive deep into our shadow selves during the full moon, and emerge 
    vibrating on a whole new level."

    nvl clear

    s "I only take 8 women per session - it's very intimate and transformational. Book now if you're ready for the next step 
    in your journey towards divine femininity! "

    n "...umm, okay. I don't know about moon goddess rituals. Sounds...culty. Maybe she has something more normal? "

    n "I tapped on a different video, this one just labeled \"Yoga & Breathwork: the most powerful combo you've been missing\""

    nvl clear

    s "Today I wanted to introduce you to two powerful somatic tools for transformation. If you haven't tried yoga and breathwork 
    together, you're missing out! Together, they're some of the most potent tools I use in my personal life and in my sessions, and 
    have been key in tapping into my own feminine power. I'll be hosting a class at the studio this Friday evening. Even if you've 
    never done either practice before, this class is for you!"

    n "That sounds a little less freaky. I've done yoga, and I assume breathwork is like those breathing exercises they give you in 
    therapy? I could give the \"Basic Yoga & Breathwork\" class a try. Worst case, it ends up being just a basic class. Best case, maybe I'll 
    be the one singing in the middle of the park next month, and not giving a single fuck."

    nvl clear

call chapter_five
